<title>NETHERLANDS: Frans Maas details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Frans Maas details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Road transport firm Koninklijke Frans Maas Groep NV said on Wednesday it had set the stock alternative to its (final) 1996 dividend at one new share for every 34 shares already held or in cash 1.90 guilders per share.</p>
<p>Frans Maas shares closed at 64.40 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday, down 1.10 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
